        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Minnesota's 10th congressional district, Minnesota's 3rd congressional district, Minnesota's 6th congressional district, Minnesota's 8th congressional district\n- People: Erik Paulsen\n- Roles: U.S. House of Representatives representative\n\nFacts:\n- Minnesota's 10th congressional district generally consisted of the area now covered by Minnesota's 3rd and 6th congressional districts and the southern portion of Minnesota's 8th congressional district.\n- Erik Paulsen was elected in 2008 to represent Minnesota's 3rd congressional district in the U.S. House of Representatives.\n- Erik Paulsen currently represents Minnesota's 3rd congressional district in the U.S. House of Representatives.",
